+ *
+ * Train: LibreWolf / Firefox 155.0.1-1. Brand: darkstr — not official LibreWolf.
+ * Loads libduppel_ffi.{dylib,so,dll} from the application directory (dist/bin)
+ * via js-ctypes and calls darkstr_ffi_persona_snapshot_json.
+ *
+ * Honesty: fails soft when the dylib is missing or symbols unavailable;
+ * callers must keep JS seed fallback. nativePersonaHooks stays default-off.
+ * No Cloudflare/TLS/JA3/RFP metric customization.
+ */
